// A #local declared `:32 unsigned` compares unsigned. A - 2660 with A = 100
// wraps to 4294964736 (0xFFFFF600); read as a signed int that is -2560 and
// `Over > 160` would be false. dl1200's MaxTime ladder reads its over-current
// this way.
#variable A:16 unsigned = 100
#local Over:32 unsigned = A - 2660
#variable OverV:32 unsigned = 0
#variable Big = 0
#variable BigV = 0
Big = 1 ? Over > 160
OverV = Over
BigV = 1 ? OverV > 160
